Make the counters of the top-set verify atomic
Fold-into: hexagon-host/0003-llama-sampler-topset.patch

The defects. tests/fuzz/core/run.sh test replays the reproducer of each one.

- Two contexts that sample in two threads race on the counters of the verify mode.

  The verify mode of the top set (LLAMA_SAMPLER_TOPSET=2) counts the equal and the different
  selections in function-static int64_t counters, in llama_sampler_topset_verify and in
  common_sampler_sample. llama.cpp permits two contexts of one model in two threads, and each
  context has its own sampler. The two threads then write the same counters with no lock, and
  TSan reports a data race.

  The change: The four counters are std::atomic<int64_t>. The counts only go to a log line.

  The reproducer: tests/fuzz/core/regress/tsan_topset--tsan-topset-counters.

Base: llama.cpp commit c6824a9 with the patches of patches/series above this one.

Files:
    common/sampling.cpp
    src/llama-sampler.cpp
